{"synopsis":"Para Pejuang Valhalla memiliki kekuatan yang disebut Saga—sebuah sihir agung yang lahir dari pencapaian dan prestasi gemilang semasa hidup mereka. Semakin luas kisah dan legenda mereka tersebar, semakin dalam tertanam di hati banyak orang, maka semakin kuatlah kekuatan Saga tersebut. Tae Ho memang bukan seorang pejuang—tapi dia adalah pemain pro game terbaik di dunia. Di dunia Dark Age, sosok Kalsted sang Kesatria Naga adalah legenda hidup. Pencapaiannya, kisahnya. Semua prestasi yang diraih Kalsted sang Kesatria Naga dalam gim! [Saga: Pejuang Abadi]— Valhalla, medan perang para dewa. Inilah kisah Lee Tae Ho, sang pejuang abadi yang akan terukir di sana. Demi mengakhiri Ragnarok yang mengancam kehancuran dunia, sebuah Saga baru kini dimulai.","alternative_title":"발할라 사가 Vallhala Saga","author":"J-Sun (현가)","artist":"Triple Line (트리플라인)","chapters":[{"number":"75","chapter":"75","slug":"1cf4f127-9eb3-416c-88b8-4574f15e21ca","title":"Chapter 75","date":"2026-04-03"},{"number":"74","chapter":"74","slug":"e1337d33-c682-4e35-b24a-f7a154e267c7","title":"Chapter 74","date":"2026-04-02"},{"number":"73","chapter":"73","slug":"be3eb770-c9b0-4c2a-9c41-58c0a9eebb74","title":"Chapter 73","date":"2026-03-26"},{"number":"72","chapter":"72","slug":"d056c3b9-96c3-4c26-8ede-ca209554dd0e","title":"Chapter 72","date":"2026-03-12"},{"number":"71","chapter":"71","slug":"e506ac36-af81-4174-ac54-6c3aa5f45715","title":"Chapter 71","date":"2026-03-09"},{"number":"70","chapter":"70","slug":"8300313d-3093-4091-b0d8-8cab852a4ac3","title":"Chapter 70","date":"2026-03-08"},{"number":"69","chapter":"69","slug":"0da763a3-e090-4304-80c8-4bf2a3c7b8fc","title":"Chapter 69","date":"2026-02-26"},{"number":"68","chapter":"68","slug":"f19f6c01-27bb-4607-a818-0d5ab5fdc7c5","title":"Chapter 68","date":"2026-02-21"},{"number":"67","chapter":"67","slug":"bff320cf-e7ac-46d4-9bed-53e3bf6aac3c","title":"Chapter 67","date":"2026-02-08"},{"number":"66","chapter":"66","slug":"9f972698-fe84-4982-96d6-44